  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given marbles are:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>→</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>30</mn><mo>→</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>20</mn><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mn>15</mn><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi></math></p><p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>Number of favourable outcomes</mtext><mtext>Total number of outcomes</mtext></mfrac></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mi>B</mi></math> are independent events.</p><p>Probability of drawing first marble red and then white is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>75</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>75</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>75</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
